completely, one hundred percent equal with no exceptions.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div> Damn that's some game of thrones shit going on there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-31T17:20:55-07:00","id":996335,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993761-the-great-equalizer?p=996073#post996073\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Damn that's some game of thrones shit going on there.</div> </div> </div> </div>We're a group consisting of two lawyers, a single anthropologist, an evolutionary biologist and a priest.<br /> <br /> We are a really weird group.<br /> <br /> It mostly started back in my original Technocracy game in 1999, where they asked me to go all out since they felt it would help the mood, and were kind of afraid that the feeling of &quot;lol we are the secret masters of the world who control everything&quot; would detract from the sense of vulnerability, and then they managed to convince me of it, and since then we've had some really intense scenes come out of doing this.<br /> <br /> The best example would probably be that one time in a game of Exalted where Empress Jasala, Ruler of Thirteen Realms, Symbol-Bride of The Sun Invincible and Solar Exalt, was killed due to being shanked twelve times in a dirty alleyway because she made a single error.<br /> <br /> It was a very emotionally tense scene, that seems hilarious and comical from our viewpoint now, but back then, the room was fucking <i>charged</i> with the emotion of the event.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is a remedy for everything but death, a hope for everything but wickedness, and everything will lapse except righteousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6042-manusdomine","name":"ManusDomine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6042_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"493"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-01T02:27:38-07:00","id":996503,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ManusDomine</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993761-the-great-equalizer?p=996335#post996335\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We're a group consisting of two lawyers, a single anthropologist, an evolutionary biologist and a priest.</div> </div> </div> </div>*squints*<br /> <br /> Wait, do you mean the <i>players </i>or the<i> characters </i>are... <br /> <br /> ...you know what, never mind. Either way it sounds like an awesome campaign.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1289-hastur00","name":"Hastur00","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1289_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"366"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-01T02:36:32-07:00","id":996504,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hastur00</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/993761-the-great-equalizer?p=996503#post996503\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> *squints*<br /> <br /> Wait, do you mean the <i>players </i>or the<i> characters </i>are...<br /> <br /> ...you know what, never mind. Either way it sounds like an awesome campaign.</div> </div> </div> </div>We are.<br /> <br /> The players are either an Amalgam of Technocrats working to purge the corruption of the Union, desperately trying not to be caught when we play cWoD or a Pylon of Seers fighting a losing war against a resurgent Silver Ladder over the city of Copenhagen when we play CofD.<br /> <br /> The priest plays the most hilarious character.<br /> <br /> She is trying to play an atheist, and it's really interesting to see a deeply devout woman play a character that doesn't believe at all.<br /> <br /> Seeing her argue with herself is <i>hilarious</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;There is a remedy for everything but death, a hope for everything but wickedness, and everything will lapse except righteousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6042-manusdomine","name":"ManusD